  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sweet peppers are colorful, crisp vegetables that add flavor and nutrition to any meal. Whether roasted, sautéed, or stuffed, they bring natural sweetness and a satisfying crunch to the table. Packed with vitamin C, fiber, and antioxidants, sweet peppers are a healthy choice for salads, side dishes, or main courses. Try sweet peppers stuffed with grains and veggies, or simply enjoy them fresh for a vibrant, wholesome addition to your diet.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-sweet-peppers\">Why You’ll Love This sweet peppers</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-sweet-peppers\">How to Make Sweet Peppers</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-sweet-peppers\">Pro Tips for Making sweet peppers</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-sweet-peppers\">How to Serve this sweet peppers</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-sweet-peppers\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This sweet peppers</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sweet peppers add vibrant color to your dishes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They&#8217;re packed with vitamins A and C for a health boost.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for snacking, grilling, or stuffing!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to grow in your garden or pots.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They bring a delightful crunch and sweetness to any meal.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3456\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3456\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div